OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785773923
OL,3,CTwo helicopters collide while tackling
OL,4,Cwildfires in Greece
OL,6,FTwo firefighting helicopters have
OL,7,Fcrashed into each other during an
OL,8,Foperation near Athens as Greece
OL,9,Fcontinues to face raging wildfires
OL,10,Famid a heatwave across Europe.
OL,12,FThe Greek fire service said the two
OL,13,FBELL helicopters were carrying two
OL,14,Fpeople each when they crashed in the
OL,15,Fwider area of Psatha, Attica.
OL,17,FVideo footage seen by ITV News shows
OL,18,Fone helicopter bursting into flames,
OL,19,Fwith another one appearing less
OL,20,Fdamaged.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
