CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785773923
OL,3,CTwo helicopters collide while tackling
OL,4,Cwildfires in Greece
OL,6,FThe two helicopters had been leased by
OL,7,Fthe fire department and had taken off
OL,8,Ffrom Elefsina military airport.
OL,10,FA search and rescue operation is now
OL,11,Funderway near Porto Germeno, with no
OL,12,Fimmediate word on the crews' condition.
OL,14,FWith much of Western Europe battling
OL,15,Fwildfires amid a prolonged continental
OL,16,Fheatwave, strong winds drove flames
OL,17,Fdeeper into the Athens region this
OL,18,Fweekend and forced fresh evacuations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
