OL,3,CTwo helicopters collide while tackling
OL,4,Cwildfires in Greece
OL,6,FFlames spread through western Attica,
OL,7,Fthe region around Athens, threatening
OL,8,Fcommunities and an industrial district
OL,9,Foutside Megara as violent gusts
OL,10,Fprevented firefighting aircraft from
OL,11,Fcollecting water from the sea.
OL,13,FNearly 500 firefighters and 23
OL,14,Faircraft were deployed, but gale-force
OL,15,Fwinds drove flames through dry forest
OL,16,Fand crippled the response, preventing
OL,17,Fsome aircraft from reaching the sea to
OL,18,Fcollect water.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
