PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785773923
OL,3,CTwo helicopters collide while tackling
OL,4,Cwildfires in Greece
OL,6,FAuthorities ordered the evacuation of
OL,7,FKandili, Agia Skepi and Toutouli as
OL,8,Fsmoke rose over the mountains.
OL,10,FCrews were particularly concerned
OL,11,Fabout Porto Germeno, a seaside
OL,12,Fcommunity on the Gulf of Corinth.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Kyriakos Mitsotakis was
OL,14,Fbriefed on the operation.
OL,16,FThe fire began Friday near Agios
OL,17,FVasileios before sweeping toward Porto
OL,18,FGermeno and into the forested
OL,19,Fmountains west of Athens.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
