OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785773923
OL,3,CTwo helicopters collide while tackling
OL,4,Cwildfires in Greece
OL,6,FFirefighters evacuated 254 people by
OL,7,Fsea Friday and another 12 Saturday `
OL,8,Foften the last escape route when fire
OL,9,Fand smoke cut the few roads from
OL,10,Fcoastal communities.
OL,12,FWildfire meteorologist Theodore
OL,13,FGiannaros estimated the blaze had
OL,14,Faffected 40 to 50 square kilometers
OL,15,F(15 to 19 square miles), though
OL,16,Fauthorities had issued no official
OL,17,Ffigure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
