OL,3,CTwo helicopters collide while tackling
OL,4,Cwildfires in Greece
OL,6,FElsewhere in Greece, flames threatened
OL,7,Fhomes on Kefalonia, forcing
OL,8,Fevacuations from inland communities as
OL,9,Faircraft made water drops over the
OL,10,FIonian island. Firefighters battled
OL,11,Fanother blaze near Nea Tenedos in
OL,12,FHalkidiki.
OL,14,FEarlier this week, two firefighters
OL,15,Fdied fighting a fire on Crete, while a
OL,16,Fthird was killed in the Peloponnese.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
