CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785773923
OL,3,CTwo helicopters collide while tackling
OL,4,Cwildfires in Greece
OL,6,F"A pristine forest, a paradise, was
OL,7,Fsurrendered to the hands of the fire,"
OL,8,Flocal farmer Minas Tzortzanis said
OL,9,FSaturday. "There are no words to
OL,10,Fexplain what has happened.
OL,11,FDestruction. Total destruction."
